  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The YEETer is a temporary troop introduced in April 2025, for the ClashaMania season. Then, he was available starting from Town Hall level 4. The YEETer was made available again in September 2026 for the \"Search for Cena\" season, as part of \"Battle Options\" features in Multiplayer Battles.",
    "When initially spawned, the YEETer throws four Tribal Tag Team members from a longer range of 7 tiles, before moving forward and attacking using his long spear within six tiles. The Tribal Tag Team comprises ground melee units that deal extra damage to Walls."
  ],
  "notices": [
    "临时单位的来源表格同步日期不表示活动开放日期；本期可用状态在页首另行说明。"
  ]
}
